OL,3,GNEWSAVideo shows hare coursing
OL,4,Asuspects' getaway
OL,5,
OL,6,FBody-worn video footage captured the
OL,7,Fmoment a police officer had to run to
OL,8,Fsafety to avoid a speeding 4x4 on a
OL,9,Fcountry lane.
OL,11,FHampshire Police said officers were
OL,12,Fcalled to land near Micheldever on 20
OL,13,FOctober, after two vehicles were
OL,14,Fspotted in a field and individuals were
OL,15,Fseen hare coursing.
OL,17,FAfter one 4x4 drove past and was
OL,18,Fpursued by a police car, an officer on
OL,19,Ffoot had to run into woodland as
OL,20,Fanother sped by.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
