OL,3,GNEWSAVideo shows hare coursing
OL,4,Asuspects' getaway
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo-one has been arrested. Releasing the
OL,7,Ffootage, Hampshire Police said those
OL,8,Finvolved in hare coursing could be
OL,9,F"dangerous and unpredictable".
